OL,3,GNEWSAAphasia group write song about
OL,4,Atheir experiences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of Londoners with a brain
OL,7,Fcondition that impacts their ability to
OL,8,Fspeak, read, write and understand
OL,9,Fothers have written a song about their
OL,10,Fexperiences.
OL,12,FThe Aphasia New Music Group, which is
OL,13,Fmade up of people living with aphasia,
OL,14,Fmusicians, and speech and language
OL,15,Ftherapists, co-create music to raise
OL,16,Fawareness of the condition and support
OL,17,Feach other.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
