OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAphasia group write song about
OL,4,Atheir experiences
OL,5,
OL,6,FAphasia is often caused by a stroke or
OL,7,Fbrain injury. Tens of thousands of
OL,8,FLondoners live with aphasia, according
OL,9,Fto the Stroke Association, and it can
OL,10,Fbe very isolating.
OL,12,FFinn Beans, lead facilitator in the
OL,13,Fgroup and artistic director, said the
OL,14,Fsong Listen was created to help people
OL,15,Funderstand what it meant to live with
OL,16,Fthe condition.
